# The pixel comparison of stage 08 writes 204 renderings here, 36MB of them, and they
# are a MEASUREMENT rather than an artefact: `node design/kit/checks/pixels.mjs before`
# and `after` regenerate the pair on demand. They are also the one thing the design
# system is not allowed to contain, by a decision recorded at stage 08: nothing on the
# stand is a picture, because a picture of a component is a second copy that goes stale
# without saying so. Stage 09 replaced them with checks/refactor.mjs, which compares two
# rendered trees element by element and needs no image at all.
